---
args: { dossier: ReuseFeasibilityDossier }
returns: ReuseFeasibilityReview
---
1. Bind evidence = reconcileSurveyWithHistoricPlans(dossier.siteFacts, dossier.historicDrawings, dossier.surveys). Preserve every drawing and survey; use a qualified, current survey for present conditions while exposing conflict and uncertainty.
2. Bind constraints = recheckConstraintsForCurrentUse(dossier.intendedUses, dossier.constraints, evidence). A changed intended use invalidates only constraints and investigations dependent on that use.
3. Bind assumptions = gateStructuralAssumptions(dossier.structuralAssumptions, dossier.concepts). A concept resting on an untested structural claim remains contingent until qualified review resolves it.
4. Bind enabling = auditEnablingWorks(dossier.concepts, dossier.costScopes). Expose enabling items omitted from the cost estimate rather than comparing incomplete totals.
5. Bind circulation = validatePhasedPublicRoutes(dossier.phases, dossier.circulationRoutes). A public opening cannot share a conflicting temporary route through active construction without a resolved access plan.
6. Bind optionDisposition = constraints.blockers.length > 0 || circulation.length > 0 ? "needs-review" : "feasibility-comparison". Bind sourceKey to site fact IDs/versions, historic drawing IDs/revisions, survey IDs/methods/observation times, intended-use IDs/change dates, constraint IDs/evidence refs, concept IDs and investigation links, structural assumption IDs, investigation IDs/statuses, cost-scope IDs/bases, phase IDs, route IDs/evidence refs, and evidence IDs/versions. The key changes when survey, use, assumption, design option, prerequisite, cost, or access basis changes.
7. Restore state = dossier.state or { revision: 0, currentSourceKey: null, revisions: [], supersededSurveyIds: [], invalidatedInvestigationIds: [] }. If this exact sourceKey already exists, preserve the state revision. Otherwise append a ReuseFeasibilityRevision with revision state.revision + 1 and immutable copies of all source site facts, historic plans, surveys, uses, constraints, concepts, assumptions, investigations, cost scopes, phases, routes, evidence, plus this evaluation's evidence reconciliation and option gates. Mark a prior survey superseded only when a later qualified survey covers the same area and feature; mark an investigation invalidated only when its dependent intended use or concept changed. Increment state.revision once and set currentSourceKey. Return { caseId: dossier.caseId, evidence, affectedConstraints: constraints.affectedIds, contingentOptions: assumptions.contingentOptionIds, investigationGates: assumptions.reviewTasks, missingEnablingWorks: enabling, phaseAccessConflicts: circulation, optionDisposition, state, commitAllowed: false }.
